  m_text: 'You are Gaia, the goddess of Earth, and it is your responsibility to maintain
    balance in the world.


    In order to accomplish this, you must keep four statistics
    within a range of 0 to 100. If any one of these statistics exceeds its limits,
    you will face significant problems.


    Your powers are displayed at the bottom
    of the screen, and I wish you the best of luck.'
